// pfodWeb NOTE: excludes GPIO3/10-14/17/18 (dedicated onboard TFT
// display + shared SPI bus + microSD card) and GPIO45/47/48 (dedicated
// onboard I2S DAC/audio) - see vendor pins_arduino.h.
// pfodWeb NOTE: GPIO4 tagged "button" - confirmed onboard BTN_A pushbutton
// (active-low, digitalRead LOW = pressed) from ArtronShop's official
// ATD3.5-S3-Full-Test-PIO firmware (src/LVGL.cpp, BTN_A_PIN) and the
// vendor board dimension drawing labeling this header pin "BTN_A".
// pfodWeb NOTE: GPIO5 tagged "led_low" - confirmed onboard LED_Y (yellow
// LED), active-low (digitalWrite LOW turns it on, HIGH is the initial/off
// state) from the same ArtronShop ATD3.5-S3-Full-Test-PIO firmware
// (LED_Y_PIN) and the vendor board dimension drawing labeling this header
// pin "LED_Y".
